{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-structure-levels","title":"蛋白质结构层次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules/protein-structure-levels","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"蛋白质结构层次\">蛋白质结构层次</h1><p>一条氨基酸链从核糖体上吐出来时只是一维的字符序列，可它在毫秒到秒的尺度内会自发卷曲成一个精确到埃（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{Å}=0.1\\,\\text{nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）级别的三维形状，而正是这个形状决定它能不能催化反应、能不能识别配体。理解这个从一维到三维的跃迁，最有用的脚手架是把蛋白质拆成四个相互嵌套的结构层次。这四层不是孤立的分类，而是同一物理现实在不同分辨率下的切片：序列编码了一切，但只有逐层组织起来才显现功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>四级结构层次按尺度递进，下一层以上一层为构件。一级结构是共价的氨基酸序列；二级结构是局部主链氢键形成的规则片段；三级结构是单条链折叠成的完整三维构象；四级结构是多条链（亚基）组装成的复合体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一级结构&lt;br/&gt;氨基酸序列&lt;br/&gt;肽键共价连接] --&gt; B[二级结构&lt;br/&gt;α 螺旋 / β 折叠&lt;br/&gt;主链氢键]&#10;    B --&gt; C[超二级结构与结构域&lt;br/&gt;motif / domain&lt;br/&gt;折叠单元]&#10;    C --&gt; D[三级结构&lt;br/&gt;单链完整折叠&lt;br/&gt;疏水核心]&#10;    D --&gt; E[四级结构&lt;br/&gt;多亚基组装&lt;br/&gt;界面相互作用]&#10;    E --&gt; F[结构与功能&lt;br/&gt;活性位点 / 别构]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一级结构&lt;br/&gt;氨基酸序列&lt;br/&gt;肽键共价连接] --&gt; B[二级结构&lt;br/&gt;α 螺旋 / β 折叠&lt;br/&gt;主链氢键]\n    B --&gt; C[超二级结构与结构域&lt;br/&gt;motif / domain&lt;br/&gt;折叠单元]\n    C --&gt; D[三级结构&lt;br/&gt;单链完整折叠&lt;br/&gt;疏水核心]\n    D --&gt; E[四级结构&lt;br/&gt;多亚基组装&lt;br/&gt;界面相互作用]\n    E --&gt; F[结构与功能&lt;br/&gt;活性位点 / 别构]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>主要相互作用</th>\n<th>典型尺度</th>\n<th>实验观测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级</td>\n<td>肽键（共价）</td>\n<td>残基序列</td>\n<td>质谱、Edman 降解、测序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级</td>\n<td>主链 N–H⋯O=C 氢键</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{–}40\\,\\text{Å}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>圆二色谱、晶体学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级</td>\n<td>疏水堆积、盐桥、二硫键</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{–}60\\,\\text{Å}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"../methods/xray-crystallography\">X 射线晶体学</a>、NMR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四级</td>\n<td>亚基界面非共价键</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;50\\,\\text{Å}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"../methods/cryo-em\">冷冻电镜</a>、SAXS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一级结构-序列即信息\">一级结构：序列即信息</h2><p>一级结构是 20 种标准氨基酸通过肽键连成的线性序列，带方向（N 端到 C 端）。肽键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C–N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C–N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C–N</span></span></span></span></span></span> 因为部分双键性质而几乎共面，这把主链的自由度压缩成每个残基两个可旋转的二面角：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span>（围绕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>N–C</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{N–C}_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N–C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span>（围绕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mtext>–C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_\\alpha\\text{–C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。这个看似细节的约束是整个折叠问题的几何基础——它把构象空间从天文数字裁剪到可折叠的子集，相关的能量学在<a href=\"../computational/protein-folding\">蛋白质折叠问题</a>里展开。</p>\n<p>序列里残基的物理化学性质（带电、极性、疏水、芳香、含硫）决定了它在折叠后倾向待在表面还是埋进内核。一个经验规律是：疏水残基（Leu、Ile、Val、Phe）倾向于聚到分子内部躲开水，而带电残基（Lys、Glu、Arg）倾向暴露在溶剂里。这种「油水分相」是三级结构的主要驱动力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>残基类别</th>\n<th>代表残基</th>\n<th>折叠中的典型角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>疏水</td>\n<td>Leu / Ile / Val / Phe</td>\n<td>埋入内核，是折叠的主要驱动力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极性不带电</td>\n<td>Ser / Thr / Asn / Gln</td>\n<td>表面氢键网络、参与识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酸性 / 碱性</td>\n<td>Asp / Glu / Lys / Arg</td>\n<td>形成盐桥、多暴露于溶剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>芳香</td>\n<td>Phe / Tyr / Trp</td>\n<td>芳香堆积、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 相互作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊</td>\n<td>Gly / Pro / Cys</td>\n<td>构象柔性 / 主链刚性 / 形成二硫键</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"二级结构-局部的规则花样\">二级结构：局部的规则花样</h2><p>当主链氢键以周期性方式形成时，链段会塌陷成两种主导花样。α 螺旋是右手螺旋，每圈约 3.6 个残基，主链氢键连接第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个残基的羰基与第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i+4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个残基的酰胺，形成沿轴向的氢键阵列。β 折叠则由多条几乎伸展的链（β 链）侧向氢键连接而成，可平行或反平行排列。</p>\n<p>判断一段序列倾向何种二级结构，Ramachandran 图是核心工具。它把允许的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\phi,\\psi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 组合画在二维平面上：α 螺旋聚在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-60^\\circ, -45^\\circ)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，β 折叠聚在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>130</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-120^\\circ, 130^\\circ)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而甘氨酸因无侧链可占据更广区域，脯氨酸因环结构受限于狭窄区域。质量好的结构里 90% 以上的残基应落在允许区，这也是验证<a href=\"../methods/xray-crystallography\">晶体学</a>与冷冻电镜模型质量的标准检查项。</p>\n<p>除两大主角外，还有转角（β-turn）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 螺旋等次要花样，它们常出现在链段方向反转处，对紧凑折叠不可或缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三级结构-疏水核心与结构域\">三级结构：疏水核心与结构域</h2><p>单条链把二级结构元件折叠打包成致密的三维球状体，就是三级结构。它的稳定核心通常是一个无水的疏水内腔，外面包着亲水表面。把若干二级结构元件按特定拓扑组合起来，会反复出现一些「超二级结构基序」（motif），比如 β-α-β 单元、希腊钥匙、螺旋束。</p>\n<p>比 motif 更大的功能单元是结构域（domain）：一段能独立折叠、常对应一个进化模块或一项功能的连续序列。多结构域蛋白把识别、催化、锚定等功能分摊到不同结构域，这种模块化让进化能像搭积木一样重组功能。同源结构域共享的整体拓扑被称为「折叠」（fold），CATH 与 SCOP 这类数据库就是按折叠对已知结构分类的。结构域如何把序列变成可执行的化学，是<a href=\"structure-function\">结构与功能关系</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四级结构-亚基的协同组装\">四级结构：亚基的协同组装</h2><p>很多蛋白只有在多条链组装成复合体后才有功能。四级结构描述这些亚基的数目、种类与空间排布，比如血红蛋白是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_2\\beta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 四聚体，病毒衣壳可由数百份相同蛋白按二十面体对称排布。亚基界面靠的仍是非共价相互作用，但因为接触面积大，整体结合可以极其牢固。</p>\n<p>四级结构带来一种单亚基无法实现的能力：协同性与别构调控。一个亚基结合配体后构象变化会传递到相邻亚基，改变它们的亲和力——血红蛋白的氧合曲线呈 S 形正是这个机制。对于由数十上百个亚基构成的庞大组装体，逐个解析变得困难，这正是<a href=\"../applications/macromolecular-machines\">大分子机器与动态结构</a>关注的领域，而其测定越来越依赖冷冻电镜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一级结构是带方向的氨基酸序列，肽键的平面性把主链自由度压缩为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi/\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> 两个二面角。</li>\n<li>二级结构是主链氢键形成的 α 螺旋与 β 折叠，Ramachandran 图刻画其允许构象并用于模型验证。</li>\n<li>三级结构由疏水核心驱动，motif 与结构域是其可复用的折叠模块，按 fold 分类。</li>\n<li>四级结构是多亚基组装，带来协同与别构，是大分子机器的结构基础。</li>\n<li>四个层次是同一序列在递增尺度下的组织，序列编码全部信息但需逐层显现功能——下一篇转向<a href=\"nucleic-acid-complexes\">核酸与复合物结构</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蛋白质结构层次","id":"蛋白质结构层次"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一级结构：序列即信息","id":"一级结构-序列即信息"},{"level":2,"text":"二级结构：局部的规则花样","id":"二级结构-局部的规则花样"},{"level":2,"text":"三级结构：疏水核心与结构域","id":"三级结构-疏水核心与结构域"},{"level":2,"text":"四级结构：亚基的协同组装","id":"四级结构-亚基的协同组装"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"核酸与复合物结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/macromolecules/nucleic-acid-complexes"}}